            <div xml:id="m-c9234565-6078-4369-af83-fa782d44d94a">
              <lg xml:id="m-9ed57703-33ad-459b-b340-8bf813a614c3">
                <l xml:id="m-0b38d1c3-3f3e-4a1f-988b-a60ac912d764" facs="#m-acbd09a3-1363-4267-8aa3-589cd4b36277" label="text-like">S. Thomas, Bishop and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-298db0e9-9ce3-42f1-b3be-6f12a98c47b3" facs="#m-e5e01ba9-2701-458c-a81f-4036ae16f4d2" label="ambiguous">437</l><l xml:id="m-3147c644-8f1e-40b6-b62a-90dba9b29147" facs="#m-1011f9d0-4f1c-45f2-b5c1-bc936bc6e7c2" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-cc9b2049-f62e-4805-a033-eb2ece6f6df1" facs="#m-76280fea-276c-4b70-bf8b-586eed1903a6" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Nativity. p. 4II (semi-double rite).</l><l xml:id="m-e970df36-cabb-475c-8b3d-efb3d34c1642" facs="#m-077e106c-7e16-41d2-b224-190f88014f18" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-02be9af7-7369-48b6-b797-59997790622f" facs="#m-1c884b61-7ff6-4dd7-9bd6-4c843f4ab588" label="ambiguous">Gal.4.</l><l xml:id="m-2ea5c1eb-d1ab-43ef-823e-df8db029807b" facs="#m-d12ef4bd-34ae-4c4d-adcd-c780f200f223" label="lyrics-like">"Ratres: Quanto témpore haeres] sed sub tutóribus et actóribus est.</l><l xml:id="m-ed3454ce-9eff-43aa-b143-afcf25daadc6" facs="#m-5419a017-fcc8-4b10-b35e-4ebc8d7e582c" label="lyrics-like">párvulus est, nihil differt a usque ad praefinitum tempus a</l><l xml:id="m-2b407d25-7d8f-4497-a536-1051d85a92c6" facs="#m-0d50a361-0337-44ee-af90-7e378a325b50" label="lyrics-like">servo, cum sit dóminus ómnium:t patre.</l><l xml:id="m-2804f6c2-88fc-4e74-bb6d-d32aede4b80d" facs="#m-c00c013d-700f-4c2e-8830-7872667255b3" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Jésu Redémptor. 365.</l><l xml:id="m-7ce1dcc2-9021-4c3d-9353-5f0cb136e571" facs="#m-96c1a57a-6843-4ed6-b184-198f6f13448e" label="lyrics-like">v. Vérbum cáro fáctum est, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-9e5041af-94ba-4ea7-af71-71f076f60c51" facs="#m-c00e4ffd-1877-4794-890c-91a228ebdf06" label="lyrics-like">R. Et habitávit in nóbis, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-0808ad8c-4c9b-4272-b1bf-6046e9d71e12" facs="#m-c5c9a96f-e45f-45e6-b851-de276a3b54ef" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-a31f117a-3eb5-4ab2-98e9-ccb2df1de561" facs="#m-7e0bb31d-d782-4d8a-9482-98ae4cdaabe1" label="ambiguous">Ant. G.1</l><l xml:id="m-c809124b-4b3a-44a6-8a6b-8dd006b6a5ae" facs="#m-90643674-3a98-4d7b-ae07-9194ccae3bc8" label="lyrics-like">U-er Jésus * pro-fi-ci-ébat aetáte et sa-pi-én¬</l><l xml:id="m-30b15f08-d210-4a49-9d59-ae046cca420b" facs="#m-94c46d22-14f8-4b5b-a7e7-98cf99e577dc" label="ambiguous">L</l><l xml:id="m-7f168422-c8cd-4c20-a843-cede86bb9b36" facs="#m-bd53795e-5234-4809-b1ea-59f5b896c09b" label="lyrics-like">coram Dé-o et homínibus. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-6db025b9-c0be-4d3a-8d52-dd12e363ad98" facs="#m-aae9f097-c1ff-48d9-827a-843de864fa6e" label="ambiguous">ti-¬a</l><l xml:id="m-72a90ab8-d1d0-4b85-97d2-718b6e0e7a8a" facs="#m-1b6971a5-f345-4182-878c-40e2deaae7bb" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 6. F. p. 211.</l><l xml:id="m-0f51fe29-497b-4898-abe8-dc744164fd95" facs="#m-e7f69506-d277-490c-ab66-90aa5a93eef3" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Omnípotens. p. 434.</l><l xml:id="m-b2dd68fa-1ace-4385-bd4d-79b86ee8e85e" facs="#m-df969671-501b-44ec-815f-04681e010b18" label="text-like">If Dec. aoth falls on this Sunday, commemoration is made of the followins</l><l xml:id="m-8c41d4cd-fd40-42bd-931d-46b92bd0800a" facs="#m-3efb2efa-6d69-48b4-be99-d717380f16b3" label="lyrics-like">day within the Octave of the Naiivity (Ant. Hódie. Y. Nótum. Prarer. Con¬</l><l xml:id="m-a52daaa5-4048-4d59-a39d-dd1206405977" facs="#m-8e3c8129-50ea-437d-b8ff-bbf50b9c82c9" label="lyrics-like">céde. p. 413), and then of St. Thomas (Ant. Qui vult venire post me. Y. Jústus.</l><l xml:id="m-e697ddde-76f0-4bb8-bd64-85b466515ae8" facs="#m-10e0fec8-d073-473e-a82a-f7ac6fbf1651" label="lyrics-like">p. 262. Prayer. Deus, pro cujus Ecclésia. p. 488)</l><l xml:id="m-27e7d758-00cb-4e49-ad3a-8efaa7bb9156" facs="#m-ad589b94-63ad-4a2a-9d1a-4a0b1b71ce1c" label="text-like">If Dec. Joth falls on this Sunday, commemoration is made of the follouine</l><l xml:id="m-cf371d8a-ac61-44c0-9a7e-ca7f9c15cce7" facs="#m-25e12390-9e19-42c0-91e1-dd2aae59ffc8" label="lyrics-like">Feast of St. Sitvester (Ant. Sacérdos et Póntifex. Y. Amávit. p. 262a. Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-3d67d7f3-e021-4304-b54f-4facde0e0854" facs="#m-f83b7bdf-2ab8-49a8-b97b-4ad6a0f6a667" label="text-like">Gregem tuum., p. 40) and then of the Nativity.</l><l xml:id="m-0ba68137-b55a-4515-82e3-6c9c327b056e" facs="#m-8fa42a45-d367-4334-9c86-85554e731aaa" label="text-like">Ir this Sunday should fall on Dec. 3rst., Vespers of the Circumcision are</l><l xml:id="m-d0922dd1-d0e8-4911-9cdc-a4bdab3a672b" facs="#m-d78813c1-1a7a-455c-8a4d-3915aeb17870" label="text-like">said, and no Commemoration is made except or a Feast of II Class, if such</l><l xml:id="m-a4bb340b-354f-48d4-9d1e-daa522ef2481" facs="#m-a89b72b0-54e4-4d5f-9388-d020e14da605" label="text-like">Feast should occur on that day.</l><l xml:id="m-33f6d0f0-ae17-432d-b0c4-46c4aecb0c19" facs="#m-23162dea-2ef2-45f9-b5db-416505367d2a" label="ambiguous">DECEMBER 29.</l><l xml:id="m-bf2cc980-51fe-4e21-bbfb-4a43b86ee9ce" facs="#m-4159a73c-e7d1-4f9d-bf1f-7811b0b3650c" label="text-like">St. Thomas, Bishop and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-5271b703-a97c-44f4-9938-c8f397630f9f" facs="#m-07cd3f76-1f00-4303-b09a-e86b4b99fec0" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-edd1aa72-0792-4dcc-a5be-8f99a2081b49" facs="#m-6af70e55-0dff-4292-aa59-454dc3fc4a18" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-6e174359-0e5a-424e-8786-285b46d6e89d" facs="#m-fc68102f-6fce-4c4a-8a2b-0276bd3d5a3e" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-3f4b8fa5-b575-40ac-8815-da20930faf4e" facs="#m-f50d641f-b2f7-4a7d-af32-195d10041cb5" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-4fdb689c-d05d-40aa-a988-f626fe7cf2a4" facs="#m-caac01f0-affb-46cb-a499-6e32e9cdd57e" label="lyrics-like">Aude-ámus * ómnes in Dó-mi- no, dí-em fé¬</l><l xml:id="m-ca7a13db-4835-4459-87e1-38ac12387d18" facs="#m-570535c3-eb34-4598-bc0c-f0ab3e021c20" label="lyrics-like">stum ce-le-brántes sub honó¬ re Thómae Márty-ris: de</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
